    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally located in a well-established and mature residential area, this spacious three-bedroom detached property is just a five-minute walk from Manor Retail Park and within close proximity to University Hospital Kerry.\r\nThe property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, comprising a welcoming living room, generous kitchen/dining area, utility room and separate storage room. A particular advantage is the inclusion of a bedroom and bathroom on the ground floor, offering excellent convenience for everyday living.\r\nUpstairs, there are two exceptionally spacious bedrooms and a recently renovated bathroom.\r\nCombining generous living space with a convenient location, this property would make an ideal family home or an excellent choice for first-time buyers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 6.0m x 3.0m \r\nLaminate floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.2m x 4.3m \r\nCarpeted floor, open fire place               \r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.7m x 3.1m \r\nTiled floor, fitted kitchen ground and eye level units, fitted cupboard, stove\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.1m \r\nCarpeted floor\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.9m \r\nFully tiled, shower, WC, WHB\r\n\r\nUtility - 3.0m x 1.9m \r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nStorage Room - 1.9m x 1.7m \r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 6.1m x 3.1m \r\nSolid timber floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.4m x 4.3m \r\nSolid timber floor\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.8m \r\nLaminate floor, bath, WC, WHB\r\n\r\n"
      },
